        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-6671, Trumbull Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Trumbull Door Pull is available in an array of finishes and each one of them seem to grant this front door handle a different style. The two-toned polished nickel and black is a very on-trend look that is perfect for modern spaces while the weathered nickel finish gives it a rustic feel. Part of RK International's Trumbull Collection, it comes packaged with all necessary installation hardware for a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/trumbull-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-171\"><b>Trumbull Cabinet Knob</b></a> and \r\n <a href=\"/products/trumbull-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-671\"><b>Trumbull Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International PH-6671 Trumbull Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:2-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-12-specifications.gif?v=1704354508\" width=\"573\" height=\"107\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Trumbull Door Pull",
                "description": "RK International PH-6671 12 Inch Trumbull Door Pull - The 12 Inch Trumbull Door Pull is available in 7 finishes and each one of them seem to grant this front door handle a different style. The two-toned polished nickel and black is a very on-trend look that is perfect for modern spaces while the weathered nickel finish gives it a rustic feel. Part of RK International's Trumbull Collection, it comes packaged with all necessary installation hardware.\r\n",
